### Dependencies — reinstalled inside the image via npm ci
node_modules/

### Secrets — must never be baked into an image layer
.env
cookies.txt
*.key
*.pem

### Runtime state — all real state lives in Neon Postgres
session/
temp/
logs/
downloads/
cache/
media/
database/
.pm2/

### VCS / CI
.git/
.github/
.agents/

### Editor / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
*.swp

### Docs and deploy scripts not needed at runtime
deploy/
*.md
!README.md

# NOTE: logo.jpeg / banner.jpeg are intentionally NOT excluded — index.js serves
# them as static routes (/logo.jpeg, /banner.jpeg), so removing them causes 404s.
